abstract: >-
  Non-commercial genealogical and historical research repository
  documenting the Lacson-Soland family and allied families,
  with connections to Iloilo, Negros Occidental, and Germany.
  Includes genealogical data, GEDCOM files, historical research,
  biographies, and machine-readable metadata.

